    "body": "Question: When the `details` element `open` attribute is added or changed, should the “DOM manipulation task source” be used for firing the event, or should the “user interaction task source” be used?\r\n\r\nThe existing spec text for `popover` uses the “user interaction task source” for that event — but in the patch in this PR branch as currently written, I have the `details` case using the “DOM manipulation task source”.",
